        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: बेचैनी",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बेचैनी — becainī — \"restlessness, unease\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बेचैनी (becainī) is becain, \"restless\", with the ending -ī that makes a noun. be- is the Persian \"without\"; cain, \"ease\", is of uncertain origin, and CDIAL has no entry for it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
